Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Evidence=20layer=20=C2=B7=20fixes=20(crosslink?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20CSS=20+=20audit-trail=20race)=20+=20Sam-prep=20(audit=20seed?=
 =?UTF-8?q?s=20+=20download)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Fix A · Add .ce-crosslink CSS to case_shell.js _injectCEStyles.
  The Evidence-tab cross-link banner (B2A.7) was declared but had no
  style rules. Banner now renders with a proper accent-tinted gradient,
  border, layout, and typography.

Fix B · Per-case promise-lock in case_audit_trail.js append().
  Two rapid attaches previously produced only one audit entry (the
  second write clobbered the first because both computed prevHash
  from an empty chain). New _lockChains[caseRef] serialises appends
  per case so concurrent attaches produce N chained entries.
  Verified by Node smoke test: race scenario now yields 2 entries
  with seq=2 prevHash pointing at seq=1 hash.

Sam-prep 1 · Seed pre-computed audit-trail entries on the three primary
demo cases (Hartley 4, Taylor 2, engine shell 0201 1). Hashes were
computed at build time with the exact same payload construction the
runtime uses, so 'Verify chain' passes on first open with no runtime
rehashing needed. Demo now opens with a non-empty audit chain that
demonstrates the concept without requiring live interaction.

Sam-prep 2 · Download audit-trail JSON button on the Repository UI.
Next to 'Verify chain', a new 'Download' button emits a signed JSON
bundle containing the full hash-chain plus a manifest header (case
ref, export timestamp, export actor, entry count, last hash, genesis
hash, format tag). Suitable for ADR / court disclosure.

Cache-bust s8a across case.html / dio.html / evidence-flights.html /
evidence-workspace.html.
